## Subsequent restoration

After this audit, the parent engineering task archived the reconstructed inputs/outputs in `reencoded-snapshot/`, then restored 34 OGG files and 48 WAV containers from the imported baseline. Raw MP3 sources and recipes were not changed. `restoration.json` and `reencoded-snapshot-manifest.json` record every hash. The original pre-restoration reports above remain unchanged; their historical scripts are retained as `.original`. The current scripts accept explicit root/output overrides so the commands above reproduce against archived evidence without overwriting original reports. The diagnostic build now verifies 147 pinned audio/input/tool files instead of implicitly re-encoding them.
